"the site is no longer authorised to use this Google Drive account, so "
"reconnect it under Ninja Forms > File Uploads"
msgstr "A webhely már nem jogosult ennek a Google Drive-fióknak a használatára, ezért csatlakoztassa újra a Ninja Forms > File Uploads menüpontban"

#. translators: %s: the reason Google Drive gave for refusing the upload.
#: includes/external/services/googledrive/service.php:346
